        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Amanda Brooks, Lauren Schacher, Shim Hyung-rae, Jason Behr, Robert Forster, Elizabeth Peña, Lindsay Lohan, James Deen, Nolan Funk, Gus Van Sant, Paul Schrader\n- Films: D-War, Dragon Wars: D-War, Cut Off, The Canyons\n- Places: Los Angeles, North America, South Korea\n- Roles: actress, screenwriter, writer, director, co-founder\n- Organizations/Projects: Chicks Who Script\n\nFacts:\n- Amanda Brooks was born on June 22, 1981.\n- Lauren Schacher was born on August 2, 1985.\n- Amanda Brooks starred in the 2006 film Cut Off.\n- D-War was released in 2007 and was released in North America as Dragon Wars: D-War.\n- D-War is a 2007 South Korean action-adventure fantasy film written and directed by Shim Hyung-rae.\n- D-War stars Jason Behr, Amanda Brooks, Robert Forster, and Elizabeth Peña.\n- Amanda Brooks starred in the 2007 film D-War.\n- The Canyons is set in Los Angeles and stars Lindsay Lohan, James Deen, Nolan Funk, Amanda Brooks, and Gus Van Sant.\n- Lauren Schacher is an American actress and screenwriter known for her role in Paul Schrader's The Canyons and as a co-founder of the podcast Chicks Who Script.",
